    "detailed_description": "Richest Thief Are you ready for an exciting adventure step by step?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this addictive game called &quot;Richest Thief&quot;, you will get the chance to become the most ingenious robber in the world of theft!<br />\r\nYou have been assigned to steal a legendary collection of diamonds in the underworld. However, as you take each diamond, the number of bandits after you will increase. The more diamonds you steal, the more points you will earn, but at the same time, the risk of bandits catching you will increase.<br />\r\nThe game offers a combination of skills and strategy. But be careful, because the bandits will be watching you at any moment! The opportunity to discover new places and tasks with constantly updated content.Are you ready? Embark on a smuggling adventure on dangerous streets and experience a suspense-filled adventure with &quot;Richest Thief&quot;!",
